  +changePropAnim(PropMonitor, bartolo_monitor_begin)
  +playSound(monitor_on)
  +waitMS(2500, '', true)
  +:monitorTalk()
  Voice From Monitor: "Hello, Bartolo."
  +:teardrop(Bartolo)
  Bartolo: "<cascade-letters scale=0.75>...por fin."
  +none()
  +walkToMarker(Bartolo, MarkerWalkD)
  +walkToMarker(Bartolo, MarkerWalkE)
  +setFacing(Bartolo, up)
  +:monitorTalk()
  Voice From Monitor: "I assume you have some news?"
  +:exclaim(Bartolo)
  Bartolo: "Yes!"
  +:angry(Bartolo)
  Bartolo: "She has just <italic>defeated</> the last of the assembly line."
  +:monitorTalk()
  Voice From Monitor: "Very good."
  +:monitorTalk()
  Voice From Monitor: "And was the <color=LIGHTBLUE cascade-letters>other one</> with her?"
  Bartolo: "Yeah... She was."
  Bartolo: "I don't know what you're so fixated on her.  She didn't appear special to me."
  +:ld(Bartolo, down)
  Bartolo: "Actually both of them seemed very plebian."
  +:ld(Bartolo, up)
  +:monitorTalk()
  Voice From Monitor: "That is somewhat disappointing, actually."
  +:monitorTalk()
  Voice From Monitor: "I would have thought that you of all people would be enamored with her <color=LIGHTPURPLE>situation</>."
  +:monitorTalk()
  Voice From Monitor: "She did defeat your creations though, did she not?"
  +:jump(Bartolo)
  Bartolo: "They were clearly defective!"
  Bartolo: "I didn't have enough time to perfect the scenario!"
  Bartolo: "It should have been much much MUCH more difficult for the pair of them to get through."
  +:lightbulb(Bartolo)
  +:ld(Bartolo, down)
  Bartolo: "I'll need to redesign the whole thing with a new set of schematics and further-refined AI."
  +:ld(Bartolo, up)
  +:monitorTalk()
  Voice From Monitor: "<cascade-letters>Relax, Bartolo."
  +:monitorTalk()
  Voice From Monitor: "This was only a test, remember.  A scouting run.  You still have your <color=LIGHTPURPLE>fortress</> set up?"
  Bartolo: "Yes, yes, I do."
  Bartolo: "The <italic>trench</> of my creations is still intact as well."
  +:monitorTalk()
  Voice From Monitor: "Good.  Good."
  +:monitorTalk()
  Voice From Monitor: "You'll get your chance to prove your creations, Bartolo."
  +:monitorTalk()
  Voice From Monitor: "I will have <color=YELLOW>Lotte</> proceed as planned."
  +:monitorTalk()
  Voice From Monitor: "You've done well so far.  Keep it up."
  +none()
  +waitMS(100)
  +changePropAnim(PropMonitor, bartolo_monitor_end)
  +playSound(terminal_beep)
